<title>USA: Polaroid sets $300 mln in two-part deal.</title>
<headline>Polaroid sets $300 mln in two-part deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-tranche debt deal from Polaroid Corp was priced on Thursday, according to lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p>BORROWER POLAROID CORP</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 6.75 PCT   MATURITY 01/15/2002</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.528  FIRST PAY DATE 07/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA3  YIELD 6.863 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB	 SPREAD 57 BP	CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>BORROWER POLAROID CORP</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 7.25 PCT   MATURITY 01/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.432  FIRST PAY DATE 07/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA3  YIELD 7.331 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB	 SPREAD 80 BP	CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((Corporate bond unit 212-859-1678))</p>
